flowchart LR
    A[Staffing Request Created] --> B[Demand Signal]
    C[Allocation Updated] --> B
    D[Availability Changed] --> B
    E[Calendar / Holiday Updated] --> B
    F[Person / Resource State Changed] --> B

    B --> G[Capacity Aggregation Job]
    G --> H[Compute Daily/Weekly Capacity]
    H --> I[Apply Working Hours & Leave]
    I --> J[Subtract Committed Allocations]
    J --> K[Compute Available Hours]
    K --> L[Persist CapacitySnapshot]
    L --> M[Publish CapacitySnapshotGenerated]
    M --> N[Dashboards / Forecasting / Alerts]

    L --> O[Capacity Planning Decision]
    O --> P[Trigger Rebalance / Staffing Action]

    P --> A
